 Problem

Developers want quick, structured feedback
on code without a full manual review cycle.

User Stories

- As a developer, I want to paste a code snippet
  and get suggestions, so that I can improve it
  before opening a PR.

- As a developer, I want suggestions split into
  clear categories, so that I can focus on what
  matters most.

 Categories

- cleaner_code
- design_patterns
- optimization
- naming_improvements

 Acceptance Criteria

- User can paste code.
- User can click Analyze.
- Analysis returns suggestions.
- Suggestions are grouped into all four categories.
- Response should be returned within 10 seconds.

 Out of Scope

- User accounts
- Authentication
- Saving history
- Multi-file analysis
